---
import ChatHandoff from "./ChatHandoff.astro";
---

<dialog class="figure-dialog council-dialog" data-dialog-id="council" aria-label="Council">
  <div class="figure-dialog__frame council-dialog__frame">
    <button class="figure-dialog__close" type="button" data-dialog-close aria-label="Close">
      <span aria-hidden="true">×</span>
    </button>

    <div class="figure-dialog__reading council-dialog__reading">
      <header class="figure-dialog__header">
        <p>Dialogue threshold</p>
        <h2>Council</h2>
      </header>

      <div class="council-dialog__explanation">
        <p>
          Council 是由两至六位已确认角色参与的对话模式。这里仅说明如何进入，不在本站选择角色，也不模拟讨论。
        </p>
      </div>

      <ChatHandoff labelId="council-chat-handoff-title" />
    </div>
  </div>
</dialog>
